msgid "\\nImport the statements your bank gives you, in the format it offers: CAMT.053 (ISO 20022), MT940 (SWIFT), OFX or\\nQFX, QIF, and CSV or Excel with a map of the columns of your bank, which is kept for the next import.\\n\\nThe journal is recognised from the account number in the file, the transactions already imported are skipped, and\\nthe file stays attached to the statement. The statements are then reconciled as usual.\\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "%(imported)s transaction(s) imported, %(skipped)s already there."
msgstr ""

msgid "A map tells Odoo how to read the CSV or Excel file of one bank: its separators, the format\\n                    of its dates and which column holds the date, the label and the amount of a transaction.\\n                    Set the map on the journal of the bank and import the file as usual."
msgstr ""

msgid "A statement is imported in a bank or cash journal, not in %s."
msgstr ""

msgid "A transaction of a bank statement file is only imported once."
